<Name><![CDATA[meanCycle]]></Name>
<Description><![CDATA[KPI 1: mean rake cycle time (h), GGS arrival to next GGS arrival.]]></Description>
<X>2660</X><Y>658</Y>
<Label><X>10</X><Y>0</Y></Label>
